  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 304.03 High/Medium Voltage Electrician Qualifications. Each applicant for a license as a high/medium voltage electrician shall have certification showing completion of a state, federal, or employer certification program approved by the board pursuant to Elec 306.\n\nSource. #10356, INTERIM, eff 6-6-13, EXPIRES: 12-3-13 (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #10420, eff 9-25-13 (formerly Elec 303.03) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Elec 300); ss by #13866, eff 4-6-24 (See Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Elec 300)",
